    [Bugfix] Gate fused GDN prefill paths on bfloat16 to fix fp16 models (ColQwen3.5) crash (#18522)
    
    This is a recurrence of #14456: the earlier fix did not add a dtype gate
    at the dispatch layer.
    
    ## Fix
    
    Gate both fused prefill dispatches in `vllm_ascend/ops/gdn.py` on
    `query_non_spec.dtype == torch.bfloat16`, so fp16 models fall back to
    the Triton `chunk_gated_delta_rule` pipeline, which supports fp16 and
    consumes the same prebuilt metadata.
    
    ## Impact
    
    - fp16 models (ColQwen3.5): prefill falls back to the Triton path
    instead of crashing
    - bf16 models (Qwen3.5 / Qwen3-Next mainline): unchanged behavior
    - Decode path untouched (`recurrent_gated_delta_rule` supports
    fp16/bf16/fp32)
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/8cc9aa5ad350f6f80cf3bebb298d410803ff75a9
    
    ---------
    
    Signed-off-by: ZT-AIA <1028681969@qq.com>

